TO : USW
FM : CCE

Thank you for tender information.
But, as you can see AESW volume, it's stupid action to fix the rate during such a long period.
In this reagrd, we don't have any interseting to take this tender and you also don't need to
offer fixed rate into AESW. AESW volume should be handled on the basis of spot(market) rate.
And also, most of biz on IAS handled by spot rate not by long term contract rate except some
major BCOs who have huge volume on IAS.
So, we don't need to proceed this tender further in my opinion.

TO : CCB

Please comment if have any.

RGDS
CCE/SM.Park
[cid:9500455_635145740271657865.png@12345678.87654321]

